{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44680","headline":"与英才言聚赋得昇天行 · 慧净","name":"与英才言聚赋得昇天行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驭风过阆苑，控鹤下瀛洲。\n欲采三芝秀，先从千仞游。\n驾凤吟虚管，乘槎泛浅流。\n颓龄一已驻，方验大椿秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧净","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}